fixture tech11_ember_stops_on_wall
doc BUILD.md s6 Ember Toss "a 600 u/s projectile that stops on walls; press again to teleport to it"; docs/adr/0010 teleport fit
room test/flat
spawn 1700 544
frames 60
input
  # Throw right at the room's right wall (its face at 1888 u), wait, teleport.
  0 R toss
  40 toss
end
expect
  mark stopped 3..39 ember_x>=1887u
  at 30 ember=1
  # The body fits beside the wall: its centre 10 u (half its width) back from the ember.
  at 40 event.teleport=1 ember=0 x<=1878u x>=1876u invuln=1
end
